uity.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Activate Continuity Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Activate Continuity Plan' activity involves activating the continuity plan in response to an incident of a certain severity.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":\"T.Incident Severity in (Medium, High)\",\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If 'Monitor Risks' occurs with a Monitoring Frequency of 7 or less (frequent monitoring), then 'Identify Risks' must also occur in the same process instance, and vice versa (co-existence).\",\"template\":\"Co-Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Monitor Risks\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor Risks' activity involves ongoing monitoring of risks at a specified frequency.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Identify Risks\",\"description\":\"The 'Identify Risks' activity represents the identification of potential risks that could impact business continuity.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Monitoring Frequency <= 7\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If 'Activate Continuity Plan' occurs with High Incident Severity, it must not be immediately followed by 'Evaluate Incident Response' with no other activity in between; some other activity must intervene between them.\",\"template\":\"Not Chain Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Activate Continuity Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Activate Continuity Plan' activity involves activating the continuity plan in response to an incident of a certain severity.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Evaluate Incident Response\",\"description\":\"The 'Evaluate Incident Response' activity involves evaluating the response time and effectiveness after an incident.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Incident Severity is High\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"At least one occurrence of 'Conduct Training' must have